    <status value="generated"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet hn-vs-9a2ed66b6061</b></p><a name="hn-vs-9a2ed66b6061"> </a><a name="hchn-vs-9a2ed66b6061"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="CodeSystem-hn-answer.html"><code>http://ltc-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/hn-answer</code></a><span title="Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification"> version &#x1F4E6;1.1.0</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c912d12a82b54">c912d12a82b54</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">使用或不使用輔具(包括拐杖、支架、義肢或助行器)皆可獨立行走50公尺以上，無安全顧慮。</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c14bf5f296beb">c14bf5f296beb</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">需他人稍微扶持(如一手攙扶)或口頭教導，才可行走50公尺以上(一口氣走完或中間休息一次)。</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-c49f45fa96d26">c49f45fa96d26</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">雖無法行走，但可獨立操作輪椅或電動輪椅(包含轉彎、進門及接近桌子、床沿)並可推行輪椅50公尺以上。</td></tr><tr><td><a href="CodeSystem-hn-answer.html#hn-answer-cfd99dada6fc9">cfd99dada6fc9</a></td><td style="color: #cccccc">不能行走50公尺，且無法操縱輪椅，完全依賴他人。</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>
